        </li>
        <li class="also-item">
          <a href="https://caseharbor.onrender.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="also-name">caseharbor</span>
            <span class="also-desc">Role-based legal case management system with query-scoped permissions and PostgreSQL backend.</span>
            <span class="also-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="also-item">
          <a href="https://github.com/KanishkSigar/liberty-drive" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="also-name">liberty-drive-3d</span>
            <span class="also-desc">GTA III-inspired 3D driving engine built with Three.js, custom vehicle shaders, day/night cycles, and physics.</span>
            <span class="also-arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="also-item">
          <a href="https://github.com/KanishkSigar/arc-track" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span class="also-name">arc-track</span>
            <span class="also-desc">Minimal daily habit tracker &amp; reflection journal with SHA-256 PIN privacy and GitHub Gist cloud synchronization.</span>
